{"unit_id":"SAOS-3624__dsh-video-storyboard#card-zh","repo":"SAOS-3624/dsh-video-storyboard","commit":"561184c52878dc268c91cc07cca50e31e001d4e6","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-video-storyboard 是 DSH 视频理解插件，可将视频按镜头切分并生成一张或多张分镜图，配套提供带时间码、字幕和镜头信息的文本索引，供模型引用具体画面。用户可查询视频内容、定位事件发生时间，并对选定片段放大查看。插件提供视频探测、分镜、局部放大、字幕和使用说明等工具，支持调节采样密度与输出策略，适合分析长视频、课程和访谈。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/storyboard/tool-spec.js:101-120","src/storyboard/tiers.js:467"]}
{"unit_id":"SAOS-3624__dsh-video-storyboard#card-en","repo":"SAOS-3624/dsh-video-storyboard","commit":"561184c52878dc268c91cc07cca50e31e001d4e6","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-video-storyboard creates storyboard images and a timestamped index from video. It samples frames by shot, aligns dialogue and timing, and supports zooming into selected segments. Tools cover probing, storyboards, subtitles, and help for finding events in long recordings.","source":"generated","evidence":["src/storyboard/tool-spec.js:101-120","src/storyboard/tiers.js:467"]}
